  "name": "A Cross-Continental Analysis on Energy Production and Economic Development",
  "description": "An integrated dataset and analysis examining the relationship between energy production, energy supply, and GDP per capita across the six major UN continental aggregates (Africa, Asia, Europe, Latin America & Caribbean, North America, Oceania) from 1995 to 2022. The analysis dataset is constructed by inner-joining two UNdata source CSVs on continent and year, yielding 36 observations (6 continents × 6 common years).",
